Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|cluster.enabled|true|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|CE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Clustering|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Clustering Smoke
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|app.server.bundles.size|1|
	When these properties
		|custom.properties|dl.store.impl=com.liferay.portal.store.db.DBStore|
	And these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|ClusteringCE#ClusteringSmoke|
	And AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'cluster=liferay-channel-control'
	Then AssertConsoleTextNotPresent the value 'com.liferay.portal.cluster.multiple'